WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
- ("Gardens of Neptune")

00:00:21.572 --> 00:00:22.501
- Alright.

00:00:22.933 --> 00:00:23.671
- Woah.

00:00:23.671 --> 00:00:25.256
- (laughing) That is so good.

00:00:25.256 --> 00:00:26.252
- What is this?

00:00:26.252 --> 00:00:27.267
- It's a damn fine shake.

00:00:27.267 --> 00:00:28.791
- Like cookie butter,

00:00:28.791 --> 00:00:30.115
but in a milkshake?

00:00:30.115 --> 00:00:32.448
- This is so, so (bleep) good.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:35.008
- It's ice cream. What do you want?

00:00:35.008 --> 00:00:37.080
- If I had known I could
blend ice cream sandwiches

00:00:37.080 --> 00:00:38.178
into this concoction

00:00:38.178 --> 00:00:39.813
I would have been doing it years ago.

00:00:39.813 --> 00:00:41.987
- The coffee gives you an adult excuse

00:00:41.987 --> 00:00:43.694
to drink a milkshake all the time.

00:00:43.694 --> 00:00:44.709
- Like I have a few of these,

00:00:44.709 --> 00:00:46.924
and I feel like I might be addicted.

00:00:46.924 --> 00:00:51.924
("Gardens of Neptune")

